    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/3d0c076e58fe3308fa1f4bf30545f64e.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/3d0c076e58fe3308fa1f4bf30545f64e.apng?t=1745943241\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once upon a time, there was a world\u2026</strong> Not our world, but a world out there called Eko. In this so-called Eko, orcs, humans, and elves lived in peace\u2014no drama, no fights in bank lines, you know? But peace never lasts\u2026 From the center of the planet, a bunch of fanatic ruminants with nothing else to do but piss the others off suddenly shows up, wrecking everything in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That said, once upon a time there was Ulton Gograk, a chill orc who lived peacefully with his love and his sandwich (yes, sandwich) until evil cows kidnapped his beloved, threw Ulton in jail, and worst of all, <strong>STOLE HIS SANDWICH!</strong> Fueled by love, hunger, and sheer motivation, Ulton becomes Eko\u2019s greatest hope for freedom. With strength, courage, and unique skills only a growling stomach can provide, he will embark on an epic journey to defeat Commander Maximus and take back everything that was taken from him. This is Ulton\u2019s Quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/272c404c59d6c4a41c402e6dc14e63cf.avif?t=1745943241\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Ulton! A hero without abs, without a gym membership, and no patience for the enemies!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/1e1627b5f621b4b352d6e780e4438756.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/1e1627b5f621b4b352d6e780e4438756.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/9f910d907cc2442f510b7bfca55b9f62.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/9f910d907cc2442f510b7bfca55b9f62.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/937df8d22ff7335c80569fa3d6bee0ef.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/937df8d22ff7335c80569fa3d6bee0ef.apng?t=1745943241\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore handcrafted stages, pixel by pixel!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/8534311cffe8e63a167fb74e0fe4d9a2.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/8534311cffe8e63a167fb74e0fe4d9a2.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome obstacles, jump to glory and find hidden places and items, but watch out for traps!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/fce69bf651e24405e0d35952548d3df0.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/fce69bf651e24405e0d35952548d3df0.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give your enemies a taste of their own medicine! Make their weapons yours!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/bfb8ead8af74d0d770c4ce2e3f99d3b8.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/bfb8ead8af74d0d770c4ce2e3f99d3b8.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evil bosses that remind you a lot of that supervisor from your last job!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/7502df891c65b8efe99572a3a8c1b86d.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/7502df891c65b8efe99572a3a8c1b86d.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch Evil cows!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/ffb50df701d6031816aa402cb441fc4a.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/ffb50df701d6031816aa402cb441fc4a.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No deep plot. Reach the end, kill the villain, and save your love\u2014simple as that!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t leave Ulton hanging, come on (it\u2019d be kinda cruel if you did\u2026). Help Ulton take down the lazy bum Commander Maximus Taurus and beat the crap out of him and his cronies. Save your <strong>world</strong>, save your <strong>love</strong>, save your <strong>sandwich!</strong></p>",
