_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/1e1627b5f621b4b352d6e780e4438756.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/1e1627b5f621b4b352d6e780e4438756.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/9f910d907cc2442f510b7bfca55b9f62.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/9f910d907cc2442f510b7bfca55b9f62.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/937df8d22ff7335c80569fa3d6bee0ef.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/937df8d22ff7335c80569fa3d6bee0ef.apng?t=1745943241\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore handcrafted stages, pixel by pixel!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/8534311cffe8e63a167fb74e0fe4d9a2.poster.avif?t=1745943241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495260/extras/8534311cffe8e63a167fb74e0fe4d9a2.webm?t=1745943241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p c